### Exemplos (VSCode REST Client)

Requisições de exemplo. Substitua `{{TOKEN}}` por um bearer de conta válida e `{{ROOM_ID}}` pelo id/código da mesa.

```http
@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = <bearer-account-token>
@roomId = <room-id-ou-invite-code>

### Snapshot do studio da mesa
GET {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Salvar provedor da mesa
PUT {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio/provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "OpenRouter",
  "baseUrl": "openrouter.ai/api/v1/",
  "apiKey": "sk-...",
  "model": "openai/gpt-4o-mini"
}

### Testar provedor da mesa
POST {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio/provider/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseUrl": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1",
  "apiKey": "sk-...",
  "model": "openai/gpt-4o-mini"
}

### Salvar persona da mesa
PUT {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio/agent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Robô da Mesa",
  "avatar": "🃏",
  "systemPrompt": "Você é um contribuidor sênior desta mesa."
}

### Salvar regras da mesa
PUT {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": ["Moeda: BRL", "Não estimar acima de 13 sem dividir"]
}

### Tentativa por não-dono → 403 FORBIDDEN
PUT {{host}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/ai-studio/agent
Authorization: Bearer {{nonOwnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hack", "systemPrompt": "x" }
```